{{#*inline "personaCard"}}
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title">{{displayName}}</div>
            <div class="card-meta">
              <code class="font-mono">{{slug}}</code>
              <span>{{tierLabel}}</span>
              {{#each roles}}<span class="badge">{{this}}</span>{{/each}}
              {{#each statusBadges}}<span class="badge{{#if muted}} badge-muted{{/if}}">{{text}}</span>{{/each}}
            </div>

            <p class="card-description">{{purpose}}</p>
            <p class="fs-sm"><strong>Verify:</strong> {{testingUsage}}</p>

            {{#if coverage.length}}
              <ul class="dev-persona-coverage">
                {{#each coverage}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}
              </ul>
            {{/if}}

            {{#if signInNote}}<p class="fs-sm">{{signInNote}}</p>{{/if}}

            {{#unless backed}}
              <p class="fs-sm">
                {{#if blockedBy}}Blocked: {{blockedBy}}{{#if userStory}} ({{userStory}}){{/if}}{{else}}No seed data{{/if}}
              </p>
            {{/unless}}

            <div class="card-actions">
              {{#if switchable}}
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{switchHref}}">Switch</a>
              {{else}}
                {{#if loginHref}}
                  <a class="btn btn-outline" href="{{loginHref}}">Log In</a>
                {{else}}
                  <span class="badge badge-muted">Not Seeded</span>
                {{/if}}
              {{/if}}
            </div>
          </div>
{{/inline}}
<div class="hero hero-sm">
  <div>
    <h1>{{page.title}}</h1>
    {{#if personasLoaded}}
    <p class="hero-subtitle">
      Permanent persona harness, development and staging only. Pick a persona and
      click Switch to act as them.
    </p>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrapper">
  {{#if personasLoaded}}
  {{#if journeyFailureText}}{{> outcome-notice text=journeyFailureText tone='no'}}{{/if}}

  <section class="card mb-8" id="dev-personas-guidance">
    <div class="card-title">How to use this page</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Start with Start here: everyday members, an organizer and the administrators. The groups below cover special cases.</li>
      <li>Switch makes you that person, with no password. Log In appears instead for someone who cannot sign in, and shows what they would see at the login page.</li>
      <li>Each card's Verify line says where to go, what to do and what you should see.</li>
      <li>Email the site would send appears on the page that waits for it, and every message is listed on the Outbox page, /dev/outbox.</li>
      <li>Refresh All Personas to Initial State puts every persona back as it started, for every tester on this site. Post a heads-up before you press it.</li>
      <li id="dev-personas-refresh-residue">The refresh is not a complete reset. These stay after it:
        <ul>
          <li>Clubs and events created through the site's forms (a club is left with no leader).</li>
          <li>Administrator changes to real members, records, events, results, clubs and work-queue items.</li>
          <li>Retired hashtags, and real members who were purged, deleted or disciplined.</li>
          <li>Edits to freestyle tricks, email templates and curated media.</li>
        </ul>
        Only a full reset clears them: on staging, a redeploy that rebuilds the database; on your own computer, resetting the local database. A full reset also deletes the accounts testers registered for themselves.
      </li>
      <li>These are made-up people. Never act on a real member.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <p class="fs-sm mb-4">
    Each persona below is a member you can act as, grouped by what it tests. Its Verify line
    names the page to open, what to do and what you should see. A persona marked blocked waits
    on a feature that is not built and is not seeded. Every seeded persona's starting state is
    checked by the catalog test, every one that can sign in is switched in and its own pages
    loaded by the persona crawl, and each meets the admin and owner checks of the authorization
    matrix. Loaded from the canonical catalog: {{personaCount}} personas, {{seededCount}} seeded.
  </p>

  <form method="post" action="/dev/personas/refresh" class="mb-8">
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline">Refresh All Personas to Initial State</button>
  </form>

  <section class="mb-8" id="dev-personas-start-here">
    <h2 class="section-heading">Start Here</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
      {{#each startHere}}{{> personaCard}}{{/each}}
    </div>
  </section>

  <div id="dev-personas-groups">
  {{#each groups}}
    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="section-heading">{{dimension}}</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        {{#each personas}}{{> personaCard}}{{/each}}
      </div>
    </section>
  {{/each}}
  </div>

  <details id="dev-personas-regression">
    <summary>Regression-only and blocked personas</summary>
    {{#each regressionGroups}}
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h3>{{dimension}}</h3>
        <div class="card-grid">
          {{#each personas}}{{> personaCard}}{{/each}}
        </div>
      </section>
    {{/each}}
  </details>
  {{else}}
    <div class="empty-state">No test personas are loaded in this database.</div>
  {{/if}}
</div>
